faqs=[('Why is the price the same for every client?','Because the deliverables are. Custom scopes are why other vendors take three weeks to send you a proposal.'),('What is the difference between video plus written and video only?','Video only is the films on their own. Video plus written adds the case study and its one page version, written from the same interviews. Same day on site either way.'),('Can I upgrade after the shoot?','Yes. We capture everything on the day regardless of package. Add the social cuts or the written assets within thirty days of the shoot at the difference in price. A Site Day upgrades the same way, with the full $2,500 coming off.'),('What if the project is confidential?','Then it runs as work for hire. Delivered into your systems and never shown publicly, to named recipients only. Same price.'),('How long until we see something?','About three weeks. A week to sort access and scheduling, a day on site, then fourteen days to your first cut. That part we guarantee. What follows depends on how fast approvals come back, which is why we do not put a date on it.'),('What do you need from my client?','Twenty minutes on camera and a release. We handle the ask if you would rather we did.'),('What if a job slips while we are on the Build Record?','Nothing is lost. Visits bank as credits, so if a project is delayed or an owner will not sign a release, spend that month on a crew story, a set of quote answer videos, or a Site Day on another job instead.'),('What do my supers need for Crew Capture?','The phone already in their pocket. We send a short shot list every week built for the stage the job is in, they film a few clips between tasks, and we do the rest. No app to install, no gear, and nobody from our team on site.'),('Do you work outside Central Ohio?','Yes. Central Ohio work is filmed by our local crew with no travel costs. Elsewhere we send a vetted crew from our network, directed by us, with the same deliverables and the same fourteen day guarantee. Travel is quoted at cost.'),('Can you cover more than one project in one day?','Yes. Three sites in one day in the same market, with shorter coverage on each. Ask on the call.'),('What if the weather turns?','We reschedule at no charge and the clock starts from the new date.'),('What if our approvals take a while?','The clock pauses. The turnaround is our time, not yours. If the owner sits on a release for three weeks, those three weeks are not counted against us, and the guarantee still stands on the rest.'),('Do we own the footage?','Yes. Your organized raw archive is included in every package.')]
