hc_gets=[('The hero film.','The piece the campaign is built around. It runs at the kickoff, the cabinet meeting, the gala and the site walk, and it sits on the campaign page for as long as the campaign runs.'),('Three social cuts.','Captioned and vertical, cut from the same interviews. They carry the campaign feed, the donor email and the job post without anyone having to make something new.'),('The quote library.','Every usable line from every interview, transcribed, attributed and sorted by theme. The case statement, the brochure, the annual report and the ask letter all pull from one place.')]
